KZ3 patch 1081 (SPU pass 63, opt-in diagnostic): publish the live spu_context of every lifted job/task run and
policy-module run (g_kz3_run_ctx_hook, defined next to spu_run_with_halt), the taskset/task id of the async task
thread (g_kz3_cur_taskset/taskid), and one scan call per SPURS watcher pass (g_kz3_stall_scan). NULL hooks unless
port/spu/kz3_stall_diag.c installs them (KZ3_STALL_DIAG=1); no behaviour change.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): context only (upstream v0.18.0 changed lines around the hunks; same change).

